<br/>
There's a single-lens 48-megapixel Wide Angle lens, so no Telephoto and no Ultra Wide lens, which also means no macro support. The other major feature that's missing is <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/magsafe/">MagSafe</a>, which is majorly inconvenient since &zwnj;MagSafe&zwnj; charging is so prevalent. There's no Camera Control button, but that's easy to do without.<br/>
<br/>
