<br/>
We definitely don't recommend buying an &zwnj;iPhone 16e&zwnj; right now, but the &zwnj;iPhone&zwnj; 17e that's going to launch very soon will absolutely be worth considering over Apple's more expensive flagship iPhones.<br/>
